msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Keeps your watched history, resume points and ratings through a library rebuild"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Watchkeeper keeps watch over play counts, resume points and user ratings, recording them as they change and putting them back after a library rebuild. It runs as a service. A restore can also be run from Programs or from a movie or show's context menu, and undone."
msgstr ""

